<title>LEBANON: Sar-Mowlem wins bid to clean Beirut port basins.</title>
<headline>Sar-Mowlem wins bid to clean Beirut port basins.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British joint venture Sar-Mowlem has won a tender to clean Beirut port basins of debris and unexploded shells from the 1975-90 civil war with a bid of $4 million, port chairman Antoine Rayyes said on Monday.</p>
<p>Rayyes said Sar-Mowlem's bid was the lowest of at least five bids. The highest bid was $12 million, Rayyes added.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 861723</p>
